<title>ESTONIA: MERKO WINS 20.5 MILLION KROONS PROJECT CONTRACT.</title>
<headline>MERKO WINS 20.5 MILLION KROONS PROJECT CONTRACT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merko, the largest construction company in Estonia, said on Thursday that its bid for a 20.5 million kroon construction project was accepted by the Jogeva county government</p>
<p>In a statement the company, which is listed on the secondary list of the stock exchange, said that project was for a school centre for children with special needs in Siimust in Jogeva county.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201/2 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
